          <p class="story-card-text">Kumawat Plumbing &amp; Electricals started in 2014 with a single set of toolbags and a focus on serving local residents around Station Road, Govindgarh. Over 12 years of active service, our growth has come purely from word-of-mouth recommendations and local trust.</p>
        </div>
