          <h3 class="story-card-title">How We Work</h3>
          <p class="story-card-text">We believe in providing practical solutions rather than excuses. Whether diagnosing short circuits, fixing low water pressure, or servicing geysers, we arrive equipped with replacement parts, complete work neatly, and clean up after finishing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-card">
          <span class="story-step">03</span>
          <h3 class="story-card-title">What We Support Today</h3>
          <p class="story-card-text">Beyond on-site repair visits, Kumawat P&amp;E delivers genuine replacement fittings, electrical supplies, and hardware directly to customers' doorsteps, combining skilled trade service with accessible local retail support.</p>
        </div>
